{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"site/kinds/agent-coding-session/v1.1.0/index.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:25:18.494974Z","id":"0868f2d0c7f13f6ad428dc5f746748dc4ce00ef7538dcedd18524c89c56c5093","body":{"detail":"All seven provider crates derive through toolpath_convo::derive_path (toolpath-copilot/src/derive.rs is a thin wrapper); document@<set> for all 9 sets. The page lists six crates and leaves out toolpath-copilot, which also calls it.","kind":"pass","ref":"git:86c325b","span":{"start":{"line":18},"end":{"line":18},"content_hash":"e54d77c150808608d946ef78d00384a96765dc6c6c74d8c41b6fde3856893e6a"},"summary":"v1.1.0: every agent-coding-session path comes from toolpath-convo derive_path — backed (copilot too, though the page's crate list omits it)","tags":["claim:kind-v110-one-derivation","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"site/kinds/agent-coding-session/v1.1.0/index.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:25:18.495010Z","id":"13e6a9cbd97ffb196f64a03d9e5199dc6ae7daa5c885919c804f289bcd4759bc","body":{"detail":"group_id appears in document@claude (46), document@claude-session (5), document@codex (2), and in no gemini, opencode, pi, copilot or cursor document. crates/toolpath-goldens/src/accounting.rs checks that Σ step token_usage equals provider and extracted totals, not the once-per-run placement the spec specifies (last step of a group_id run carries the total, the rest none).","kind":"concern","ref":"git:86c325b","span":{"start":{"line":22},"end":{"line":22},"content_hash":"1ef5d5882470b2e706997bbd53e0d1e237d9e62f0cd53b326b8b6b8a26ddb4f6"},"summary":"v1.1.0 change: optional group_id and group-level accounting — group_id only on claude and codex; the group rule is not tested as worded","tags":["claim:kind-v110-changed-group-id","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"site/kinds/agent-coding-session/v1.1.0/index.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:25:18.495042Z","id":"d72f272fc809989e7aeca362b8b7c5e3cdd904a4749f85f7c1660364cc5d7e27","body":{"detail":"meta.kind …/v1.1.0 on every document@<set>.snap; cross_harness_matrix::no_source_spells_the_superseded_kind_outside_the_legacy_constant.","kind":"pass","ref":"git:86c325b","span":{"start":{"line":22},"end":{"line":22},"content_hash":"1ef5d5882470b2e706997bbd53e0d1e237d9e62f0cd53b326b8b6b8a26ddb4f6"},"summary":"v1.1.0: the only version producers write — backed","tags":["claim:kind-v110-only-version-written","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"site/kinds/agent-coding-session/v1.1.0/index.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:25:18.495074Z","id":"04ece1a2d22a4bac1c9c0a7e5a8c4403e100621bde9b93a90981a3ec8d4d9fbb","body":{"detail":"site/kinds/agent-coding-session/v1.1.0/schema.json requires [type, role, text]; validate@<set>.snap is valid for all 9 sets (crates/toolpath-goldens/src/validate.rs applies the v1.1.0 schema).","kind":"pass","ref":"git:86c325b","span":{"start":{"line":28},"end":{"line":28},"content_hash":"11a396f4a34f7839aa9eb4b1a22610df6cec080793463e7c15c62a01fd882f6b"},"summary":"v1.1.0: conversation.append always carries type, role, text — backed","tags":["claim:kind-v110-turn-payload","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"site/kinds/agent-coding-session/v1.1.0/index.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:25:18.495104Z","id":"ed5efc0a02652fc893579c97bc4e5303f6a7f0826bb7830f6b2907dc125147f2","body":{"detail":"No test checks where token_usage sits within a group_id run; accounting.rs only checks the sums. JSON Schema cannot express it (the page says producer test suites enforce it), and none does.","kind":"concern","ref":"git:86c325b","span":{"start":{"line":60},"end":{"line":60},"content_hash":"2be6ac27691909e00dab7fde749b525d6e7ec1bfbf2b2248581775b96c0b6f9b"},"summary":"v1.1.0 group accounting rule (last step of a run carries the total) — not tested","tags":["claim:kind-v110-group-last-step","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"site/kinds/agent-coding-session/v1.1.0/index.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:25:18.495179Z","id":"f1ff2082a8122eca2a3ec1ee600fd8986dceccbc4b37b49fc8e72f7d14d67a38","body":{"detail":"Asserted by crates/toolpath-goldens/tests/goldens.rs via accounting::check (Σ steps == provider total_usage == extract_conversation total_usage). Pinned exceptions: gemini-total-usage-drops-breakdowns (reasoning 489), opencode-total-usage-drops-breakdowns (285), copilot-session-totals-not-on-steps. A fix for all three is in progress.","kind":"concern","ref":"git:86c325b","span":{"start":{"line":63},"end":{"line":63},"content_hash":"dfa39b8d008f9c3b2e227fb6b6cf6c134c4b7057ec582237ee3cd07394dcff44"},"summary":"v1.1.0: Σ token_usage over steps = session totals — holds for 6 sets, broken for gemini, opencode, copilot","tags":["claim:kind-v110-session-totals","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"site/kinds/agent-coding-session/v1.1.0/index.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:25:18.495218Z","id":"e18cfeb533ac87dfcb5a6823ccb021e13545141caf01f0b710b4fdc9200abc9c","body":{"detail":"document@codex.snap carries attributed_token_usage; document@claude.snap carries none.","kind":"pass","ref":"git:86c325b","span":{"start":{"line":77},"end":{"line":77},"content_hash":"053cc74c29ebb9fd6e7c2fe8c899610e2024e6b78b18cb937a82c3c3b7b777f3"},"summary":"v1.1.0: attributed_token_usage is written by Codex, not by Claude — backed","tags":["claim:kind-v110-attributed","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
