{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"site/kinds/agent-coding-session/v1.1.0/index.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:26:54.095975Z","id":"484aecadbd4977b1453ee322531c72dcf76c8cc9c297f33aa7f90c45d8c52a16","body":{"detail":"crates/toolpath-goldens/tests/goldens.rs asserts accounting::check (Σ conversation.append token_usage == provider total_usage == extract_conversation total_usage) with no known-defect exception left: gemini 7637753 and opencode 80e8a16 add the turns' breakdowns, copilot 9eec499 settles session.shutdown's totals on the last assistant turn (pr/27). The once-per-run placement inside a group is a separate claim (kind-v110-group-last-step).","kind":"pass","ref":"git:04afa53","span":{"start":{"line":63},"end":{"line":63},"content_hash":"dfa39b8d008f9c3b2e227fb6b6cf6c134c4b7057ec582237ee3cd07394dcff44"},"summary":"v1.1.0: Σ token_usage over steps = session totals — backed for all 9 sets","supersedes":"f1ff2082a8122eca2a3ec1ee600fd8986dceccbc4b37b49fc8e72f7d14d67a38","tags":["claim:kind-v110-session-totals","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
